I have making some observations about named weapons.  Here is a scenario
with some minor spoilers:

When I am hasted, STR 23, DEX 23, +5 ring of increase damage, maximum
luck and polymorphed into a marilith (which hits 6 times a round)  I
can kill the wizard in one round with Frost Brand, but not Excalibur
(both at +7).  That would mean Frost Brand must do extra damage.  But
what damage is that!  I can't figure it out from the source code.

Here is a table for each of the named weapons against the Wizard of
Yendor:

+7 Frost Brand 190/round
+7 Mjollnir 150/round
+7 Excalibur 140/round
+7 Stormbringer 130/round
+7 Vorpal Blade 110/round (possible decapitation)
+7 Magicbane 100/round (possible stun)

I didn't test Fire Brand because the WoY is fire resistant.

These of course vary a little due to the randomness of things, but they
are pretty close for most cases.

Although I tested this in wizard mode, all of this is possible in the
regular game.
